ally had been just a slave  to her ackermann genes as erin claimed  then she never could have been able to  attack him and quite possibly  end his life but because she wasn't  really a slave  and because all of her devotion to aaron  up to this point was real  she was able to take that tragic step  and end  aaron's life even though all she ever  wanted was just to be with him  this moment was haunting and beautiful  and terrifying  all at once and it gave so much more  depth  and meaning to mikasa's entire character  and to the tragic relationship between  mikasa and aaron  it's hard to find the words to describe  the beauty and tragedy  of this love story for his entire life  aaron has been trying to do the right  thing  from risking his life to save mikasa  when they were both just children  to joining the survey corps in an  attempt to save humanity from the titans  to initiating the rumbling as the only  way to save his loved ones from the  hatred and violence of the outside world  in order to see his plan through to the  end aaron had to abandon his own  humanity  and he had to abandon his feelings for  mikasa armin and everyone else in his  life he decided to deliberately push  them all away  so that they wouldn't have to shoulder  the burden and the guilt of the rumbling  along with him he was determined to  shoulder that terrible burden  on his own but in the end aaron  seemingly chose mikasa  over his grand master plan and over his  own life  judging by what we know up to this point  aaron must have been the one who told  mikasa how to stop him  how else would she have known that his  body was inside the titan's mouth  and then mikasa did stop him proving  once and for all that her feelings for  him were real  always from the very beginning that is  truly powerful and beautiful  and also so damn sad but what else could  we expect from isayama and attack on  titan  now as of the making of this video there  is still one more chapter of the story  that is yet to come out  and amir fritz just standing there and  smiling in the final panel of chapter  138 was very interesting so who knows  what's going to happen  in the final chapter could emir use her  power to  undo some of the things that happened  since the rumbling began  or could she maybe use her power to  somehow keep aaron alive  now that aaron has proven that he loves  mikasa more than his own master plan  maybe amir will decide that it is time  for her to intervene  and guide the story towards a new less  tragic  path there is no way to know for sure so  we'll have to wait and see  but no matter what happens in the final  chapter the story of mikasa  and aaron is already one of the most  tragic and beautiful  love stories in anime and manga at least  in my opinion  let me know what you guys think did you  like the story of aaron and mikasa  up to this point and what do you think  is going to happen  in the final chapter is aaron really  dead or is amir fritz about to change  the game  don't forget to leave your feedback down  in the comments below  if you enjoyed this video and you want  to see more attack on titan content here  on the channel please leave a like to  let me know it really does help  and if you're new to anime out pro or  maybe you watch our videos but you  haven't subscribed yet  make this the video do you subscribe and  hit that notification bell to turn  on all notifications don't forget to  check out my weekly anime podcast  the rant cafe anime podcast available  for free  only on spotify you can just search for  rent cafe on spotify or click the link  in the description and in the pinned  comment  a big thank you to all of our anime  outpour patrons for making videos like  this one  possible special thank you to alpha  sigma  disciple of lord twigo himself and i  can't forget all of our  the one tier patrons the ones who rise  above all  other clans including ingrata the world  a quiet respect pate heffa liam thompson  algertol dr cortman jo